//@version=6
indicator("SR Smart Entry AI PRO v3.9 Optimized Core", shorttitle="SR AI v3.9 OC", overlay=true, max_lines_count=500, max_labels_count=500, max_boxes_count=100, max_bars_back=300)
//======================================================
// ERROR-FREE RESTORED PATCH VERSION
// Based on original script only
// Safe patches included:
// 1) Stable BUY/SELL build margins
// 2) Pending kill less aggressive
// 3) Build/kill locked to confirmed bars
// 4) Faster entry support using existing setupScore/setupGrade only
// 5) Cleaner default visuals (less PRE clutter)
//======================================================


//======================================================
// SYNC/CALIBRATION PASS (no new features):
// 1) Snapshot now freezes canonical buyUnifiedScoreAdj/sellUnifiedScoreAdj
//    (was raw final score) -> no score jump when a setup locks.
// 2) Removed redundant DEL3 buyFlowSyncEff/sellFlowSyncEff (sync was
//    double-counted live). DEL3 score == DEL2 grade basis now.
// 3) gradeContextAdj carried through DEL3 live grade (regime penalty
//    no longer dropped while scanning).
// 4) AI confidence passthrough removed; DEL3 reads buyConfEff/sellConfEff.
// NOTE: effective-score scale shifted slightly (lower in chaotic/crowded
// regimes). Re-eye leverage tiers at the 9.0/7.0/5.5 breakpoints.
//======================================================
//======================================================
// REFAKTOR-PASS (de-duplicering av score-engines):
// Confluence, Premium Quality och Engine Agreement injicerades tidigare i
// base score + context score + sync score (+ seed) -> samma signaler räknades
// 4-5 ggr. Nu bidrar varje engine EXAKT en gång via buyQualityScore/
// sellQualityScore (se "UNIFIED QUALITY SCORE"). Gamla buySyncScore/
// sellSyncScore är borttagna. Booleans (Ready/Strong/PremiumReady/
// EngineAgreement) används fortfarande som grindar/trösklar. Score-skalan är
// kalibrerad för att ligga kvar runt grade-trösklarna 9.0/6.8/5.4 - verifiera
// frekvens/grade-fördelning på TradingView och fin-trimma vikterna i
// QualityScore vid behov.
//======================================================
//======================================================
// TIMEFRAME ADAPTIVE SETTINGS
//======================================================
